# Keep local Rust/Lean build trees, credentials, and the repository history out
# of the image build context. The demo needs only these sources.
**
!rust/
!rust/Cargo.toml
!rust/Cargo.lock
!rust/rust-toolchain.toml
!rust/crates/
!rust/crates/**
!aivm_secrets/
!aivm_secrets/**
!dev/
!dev/offline_native_guest.py
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!examples/
!examples/garrett-stateless/
!examples/garrett-stateless/walkthrough.py
!examples/garrett-stateless/synthetic_provider.py
# Do not copy local output, caches, or bytecode even below included roots.
rust/target/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
